<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lithia rated outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lithia rated outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities Inc said Tuesday it initiated coverage of Lithia Motors Inc with an outperform rating for the near six month and intermediate 18-month term.</p>
<p>-- Its earnings per share estimates are for $0.51 for FY96, $0.83 for FY97 and $1.15 for FY98.</p>
<p>-- EVEREN's price targets are $16 for the six-months and $19 for the 18 months.</p>
<p>-- Lithia Motors was at 12-1/4, up 1/2.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
